      "writtenOn": "2025-10-06T19:38:40Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I am pretty sure we can get rid of the `raw` and `simple` terminology with the introduction of `fpinfo` version 2. We just need to update the `frame_size` for each capture type based on whether it is a `raw` or a `simple` capture. I believe `simple` and `raw` was introduced to account for different captures having a different `frame_size` that the default value.",
